---
import { organosGobierno } from '../data/content';
---

<figure class="gov-chart">
  <figcaption class="visually-hidden">
    Estructura de gobierno proyectada. La Asamblea General de Asociados es el órgano superior;
    de ella dependen el Consejo Directivo, la Dirección Ejecutiva, el Consejo Consultivo de
    Políticas Públicas y el Órgano de Vigilancia.
  </figcaption>
  <ol class="gov-chart__tree">
    <li class="gov-chart__root">
      <span class="gov-chart__node gov-chart__node--root">{organosGobierno.asamblea}</span>
      <ol class="gov-chart__branch">
        {organosGobierno.organos.map((organo) => (
          <li>
            <span class="gov-chart__node">{organo}</span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </li>
  </ol>
</figure>

<style>
  .gov-chart {
    margin: 0;
    overflow-x: auto;
    padding-block: var(--space-md);
  }

  .gov-chart__tree,
  .gov-chart__branch {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .gov-chart__root {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .gov-chart__node {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    min-height: 3.2rem;
    padding: var(--space-xs) var(--space-md);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }

  .gov-chart__node--root {
    background: var(--color-blue-deep);
    color: var(--color-white);
    min-width: 18rem;
  }

  .gov-chart__root::after {
    content: '';
    width: 2px;
    height: var(--space-md);
    background: var(--color-border);
  }

  .gov-chart__branch {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
    padding-top: var(--space-md);
    min-width: min(64rem, 100%);
  }

  .gov-chart__branch::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 12%;
    right: 12%;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--color-border);
  }

  .gov-chart__branch li {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    flex: 1 1 12rem;
  }

  .gov-chart__branch li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: calc(-1 * var(--space-md));
    left: 50%;
    width: 2px;
    height: var(--space-md);
    background: var(--color-border);
  }

  .gov-chart__branch .gov-chart__node {
    width: 100%;
    background: var(--surface-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-top: 3px solid var(--color-turquoise);
    color: var(--color-blue-deep);
  }
</style>
